hart-base\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"206.9907284768212\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"206.9907284768212\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,3\"/><polyline class=\"chart-line\" points=\"62.96232142857143,339.75 143.32307692307694,284.0 245.18945945945944,234.43243243243242 320.79583333333335,179.77777777777777 370.228,140.85 409.25533039647576,72.51982378854626\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 1%&amp;#10;It rained 12% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 224 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"62.96232142857143\" cy=\"339.75\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 24%&amp;#10;It rained 27% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 78 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"143.32307692307694\" cy=\"284.0\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 53%&amp;#10;It rained 41% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 74 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"245.18945945945944\" cy=\"234.43243243243242\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 74%&amp;#10;It rained 56% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 72 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"320.79583333333335\" cy=\"179.77777777777777\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 88%&amp;#10;It rained 66% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 80 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"370.228\" cy=\"140.85\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 99%&amp;#10;It rained 85% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 227 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"409.25533039647576\" cy=\"72.51982378854626\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What the forecast promised</text><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"15\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(48%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p>In Sunshine Coast the forecast is most skilful in\n<b>summer</b> (0.38) and least in\n<b>autumn</b> (0.14).</p>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th>Season</th><th class=\"num\">Days</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Rain days</th><th class=\"num\">Skill score</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Avg error</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>autumn</td><td class='num'>180</td><td class='num'>42%</td><td class='num'>0.136</td><td class='num'>17.5%</td></tr><tr><td>winter</td><td class='num'>172</td><td class='num'>51%</td><td class='num'>0.160</td><td class='num'>15.4%</td></tr><tr><td>spring</td><td class='num'>220</td><td class='num'>64%</td><td class='num'>0.318</td><td class='num'>8.8%</td></tr><tr><td>summer</td><td class='num'>183</td><td class='num'>32%</td><td class='num'>0.379</td><td class='num'>7.9%</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">Four-way splits of a two-year record are thin, so read the\nordering as indicative. Coarser binning is used here than for the annual curve\nfor the same reason.</p>\n"},"lat":-26.65682,"lon":153.07955,"n":755,"n_cities":213,"name":"Sunshine Coast","offset_days":-1,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.12,"lo":0.0,"mean":0.014017857142857143,"n":224,"obs":0.11607142857142858,"sig":true},{"hi":0.3760000000000002,"lo":0.12,"mean":0.24102564102564109,"n":78,"obs":0.2692307692307692,"sig":false},{"hi":0.66,"lo":0.3